         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">A non-invasive tool for assessing pathogen prevalence in koala (Phascolarctos cinereus) populations: detection of Chlamydia pecorum and koala retrovirus (KoRV) DNA in genetic material sourced from scats</rdf:li>
